================================================================
  _crosshair_test/ — version history of the SN crosshair iteration
================================================================

This directory holds historical snapshots of the SN-crosshair / cutout
PNG work.  Each version is a stage in the iteration; we keep them all
so we can compare progress and never lose context for an earlier
result.

Open index.html at this directory for a clickable version listing.

